---

Follow the issue-management rules in `docs/issues-rules.md` — it is the single
source of truth for how issues, sprints and the changelog work in this repo
(frontmatter model, statuses, closure discipline).

When the user asks for the todo/status listing, run
`python3 scripts/todo_status.py --full` and paste the ENTIRE output verbatim
inside one code block — never summarize, trim or reformat it.
